{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117537","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117537","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117537.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117537.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-10T15:38:25Z"},"body":"### What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nNone that I'm aware of. This is only code cleanup.\r\n\r\n### Does this PR include any additional changes beyond those required to solve these problems?\r\n\r\nNo.\r\n\r\n### What is the rationale for the approach used in this PR?\r\n\r\nThese swap chain formats were introduced by #94496. When that PR was first written, it allowed support of 10-bit swap chain formats for the purpose of HDR10 (PQ-encoded) swap chain buffers. These were eventually removed from the PR, but the swap chain formats were left in either accidentally or for use by other PRs like Android.\r\n\r\n### Was AI used to create a portion of this PR?\r\n\r\nNo.\r\n\r\n### Are there any parts of this PR that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers?\r\n\r\n#101977 currently makes use of these swap chain formats to support HDR via HDR10 encoding. I expect the Android PR to be updated to no longer use these formats. I'm leaving this PR as a draft until Android HDR output is merged, which will give us information on whether these swap chain formats will ever be needed.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117537/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}